IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `mboa-organisations`

-- Mutual Benefit Organisations Act 1960, ss 2, 6, 7, 9(3), 12, 17, 18, 22(4), 25-28, 34, 36-40, 42, 44-48 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_mutual-benefit-organisations-act-1960.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

